{"scene_id": "s01890", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/gen/scenes/s01890.fountain", "heading": "INT. DEFUNCT CLOWN COLLEGE, DORMITORY HALL - MORNING", "cast": [{"id": 0, "name": "PROFESSOR BARNABY QUILLFEATHER", "names": ["PROFESSOR BARNABY QUILLFEATHER", "BARNABY"], "gender": "m", "first": 4, "spoke": 15}, {"id": 1, "name": "MINNIE FLOCKHART", "names": ["MINNIE FLOCKHART", "MINNIE"], "gender": "f", "first": 5, "spoke": 11}, {"id": 2, "name": "DOODLE", "names": ["DOODLE"], "gender": "?", "first": 6, "spoke": 5}, {"id": 3, "name": "OKAFOR-LINN", "names": ["OKAFOR-LINN"], "gender": "?", "first": 6, "spoke": 0}, {"id": 4, "name": "HATTIE", "names": ["HATTIE"], "gender": "?", "first": 38, "spoke": 6}, {"id": 5, "name": "VON BLOOM", "names": ["VON BLOOM"], "gender": "?", "first": 38, "spoke": 0}], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "INT. DEFUNCT CLOWN COLLEGE, DORMITORY HALL - MORNING", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "Peeling circus-stripe wallpaper.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "Trunks in the corner.", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "Three oversized shoes on a shoe rack, one of them nesting a pigeon.", "para": 0, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "PROFESSOR BARNABY QUILLFEATHER (60s, ringmaster's coat over pajamas, magnificent mustache) sits on a cot in his stocking feet, holding a custard pie in each hand like a man weighing his sins.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "Across from him, MINNIE FLOCKHART (30s, her red nose hanging on a string around her neck) stuffs a polka-dot suitcase.", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "Beside her, DUKE \"DOODLE\" OKAFOR-LINN (40s, half-face of white greasepaint) retapes a unicycle tire.", "para": 1, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 7, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Minnie, my dear, you can't leave.", "name": "BARNABY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 8, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I have a bus ticket, Barnaby.", "name": "MINNIE", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 9, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "A bus ticket is a coward's instrument.", "name": "BARNABY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 10, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's a Greyhound.", "name": "DOODLE", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 11, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Doodle. Please. Say something to her.", "name": "BARNABY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 12, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Minnie, don't leave.", "name": "DOODLE", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Doodle, stop.", "name": "MINNIE", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I forbid it.", "name": "BARNABY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "^I'm thirty-four!", "name": "MINNIE", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "action", "text": "Silence.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "action", "text": "Barnaby looks into the pie in his right hand.", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 18, "kind": "action", "text": "Doodle rolls the unicycle forward and back.", "para": 2, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 19, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Then I shall tell you a story, and you will stay, because the story is true.", "name": "BARNABY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 20, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Barnaby, it's always the same story.", "name": "MINNIE", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 21, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It is never the same story. It is the same ending.", "name": "BARNABY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 22, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "That's what I said.", "name": "MINNIE", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 23, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Allow me.", "name": "BARNABY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 24, "kind": "action", "text": "He stands.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 25, "kind": "action", "text": "The cot creaks.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 26, "kind": "action", "text": "He sets both pies on the footlocker, extremely carefully.", "para": 3, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 27, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "In nineteen seventy-one, a young man arrived at this very hall with a suitcase, a bad mustache, and a dream. He was told he had no talent. He was told this by a woman who is now deceased and whose pie he now owns. He was told that comedy is a discipline of falling. Do you know what he did?", "name": "BARNABY", "speaker": 0, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 28, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "He fell.", "name": "MINNIE", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 29, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "He fell. Every day. For fifty years. And every day he stood up again, because falling is the only part of this profession that is not an act.", "name": "BARNABY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 30, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "That's beautiful, Prof.", "name": "DOODLE", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": ["sniffling"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 31, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's a lovely speech. It's also what you said when the roof leaked.", "name": "MINNIE", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 32, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "That, too, was a fall.", "name": "BARNABY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 33, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Barnaby. They closed the school.", "name": "MINNIE", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 34, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Not in spirit.", "name": "BARNABY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 35, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "In every other way.", "name": "MINNIE", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 36, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Yes.", "name": "BARNABY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": ["a pause"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 37, "kind": "action", "text": "The door creaks.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 38, "kind": "action", "text": "HARRIET \"HATTIE\" VON BLOOM (70s, severe gray bun, wheeling a suitcase of her own) stands in the doorway.", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 39, "kind": "action", "text": "She looks at the pies, the mustache, the unicycle, the suitcase.", "para": 4, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 40, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I received your letter.", "name": "HATTIE", "speaker": 4, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 41, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Hattie.", "name": "BARNABY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 42, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You said the school was dying. You said you needed a clown who could weep and a clown who could fall.", "name": "HATTIE", "speaker": 4, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 43, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "That's Doodle and me.", "name": "MINNIE", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 44, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I am the clown who can do both.", "name": "HATTIE", "speaker": 4, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 45, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Prof, who is this?", "name": "DOODLE", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 46, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "My former wife.", "name": "BARNABY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": ["faint"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 47, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I've never heard of a former wife.", "name": "MINNIE", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": ["to Doodle, low"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 48, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Me neither.", "name": "DOODLE", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": ["low"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 49, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Barnaby. Put down your pie.", "name": "HATTIE", "speaker": 4, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 50, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's on the footlocker.", "name": "BARNABY", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 51, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Then pick it up and throw it.", "name": "HATTIE", "speaker": 4, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 52, "kind": "action", "text": "Barnaby looks at her.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 53, "kind": "action", "text": "A long beat.", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 54, "kind": "action", "text": "Then, with the care of a surgeon, he lifts one pie and hands it to her, face-first.", "para": 5, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 55, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Thank you.", "name": "HATTIE", "speaker": 4, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": ["smiling for the first time"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 56, "kind": "action", "text": "She sets it on his head.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 57, "kind": "action", "text": "Minnie closes the suitcase.", "para": 6, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 58, "kind": "action", "text": "She sits.", "para": 6, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 59, "kind": "action", "text": "Doodle starts to laugh.", "para": 6, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}]}